@page "/components/button"

<PageTitle>Button — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Button</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Six variants, eight sizes, and an <code>Href</code> where shadcn writes <code>asChild</code>.
    A button that starts an Unpoly request grows its own spinner from <code>.up-active</code> —
    no parameter, no state.
</p>

