<h2 class="doc-h2">Link</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The variant, which is a button that <i>looks</i> like a link. For something that goes
    somewhere, see <a href="#as-link">As Link</a> below — the two are not interchangeable, and
    using the first where you meant the second gives you a control the browser will not open in
    a new tab.
</p>
